器\n1. 在 **Load OpenPose JSON 节点** 上 **右键点击**。  \n2. 选择 **Open in OpenPose Editor** 打开编辑界面。  \n\n---\n\n## 📌 步骤 4：调整骨骼位置\n1. 上传刚才保存的 **首帧图像**。  \n2. 点击 **锁定按钮**，避免图像移动。  \n3. 将骨骼点手动拖拽至对应的人体位置。  \n   - **手部与面部的小骨骼点**不需要精确对齐，只需大致位置对应即可。  \n\n---\n\n## 📌 步骤 5：发送到 ControlNet\n1. 点击 **发送到 ControlNet**。  \n2. 按下 **Ctrl + B** 打开 **组 \"4\"** 的节点。  \n3. 点击 **运行**，即可完成整个流程。  \n\n---\n\n✨ 至此，你已成功完成动作引导视频的预处理与骨骼编辑。  \n\n---\n\n**作者：SSsnap**\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [408.2173767089844, 818.5685424804688], "pos": [-2242.609130859375, 1990.580810546875], "id": 110, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 4}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.18.9", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [3099.16211215252, -1592.2961075456253], "scale": 0.3719008264462821}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 1, "title": "4", "bounding": [475.2662353515625, 2133.503173828125, 686.4667358398438, 1181.4947509765625]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 2, "title": "1", "bounding": [-1806.435546875, 1960.859130859375, 1795.639892578125, 913.3746337890625]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 3, "title": "1.1", "bounding": [-1805.7904052734375, 2903.674560546875, 881.4838256835938, 742.5562744140625]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 4, "title": "3", "bounding": [77.05994415283203, 2437.797607421875, 345.36871337890625, 1057.2327880859375]}], "links": [[3, 1, 0, 2, 1, "SCALES"], [7, 8, 1, 2, 0, "POSE_KEYPOINT"], [9, 10, 0, 11, 0, "POSE_KEYPOINT"], [13, 11, 0, 1, 0, "POSE_KEYPOINT"], [14, 8, 1, 1, 1, "POSE_KEYPOINT"], [72, 2, 0, 63, 0, "POSE_KEYPOINT"], [98, 11, 0, 2, 2, "POSE_KEYPOINT"], [99, 63, 0